OL,3,GNEWSAHow Leeds Christmas Market could
OL,4,Arival York after big changes
OL,5,
OL,6,FJust a few steps away from the newly
OL,7,Frenovated Leeds Railway Station
OL,8,Fentrance, wooden wagons trimmed with
OL,9,Ftinsel and lights welcome visitors into
OL,10,Fthe city's Christmas Market for 2026,
OL,11,Fand this year, alongside the
OL,12,Ftraditional Bavarian traders who have
OL,13,Fbeen a regular feature of the event,
OL,14,Fthe faces of the vendors fuelling the
OL,15,Ffestive spirit may be more familiar to
OL,16,Fthose who call the city home than
OL,17,Fusual.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
