OL,3,GNEWSAHow Leeds Christmas Market could
OL,4,Arival York after big changes
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I noticed a lot of Yorkshire-based
OL,7,Ftraders and restaurants and I think it
OL,8,Fis really good," says Simon Bayliss,
OL,9,Fone of the 61 local vendors plying
OL,10,Ftheir trade on the opening night of the
OL,11,FChristmas Market in City Square.
OL,13,FThis year, Yorkshire-based businesses
OL,14,Fhave been a focus for the market's
OL,15,Forganisers, with Leeds City Council
OL,16,Faiming, as it has put it, to "showcase
OL,17,Fthe very best our region has to offer".
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,390,380,200,160,0,100
