OL,3,GNEWSAHow Leeds Christmas Market could
OL,4,Arival York after big changes
OL,5,
OL,6,FBayliss, who in the summer is busy
OL,7,Fserving festivalgoers at Glastonbury
OL,8,Fand Download, hopes the change of focus
OL,9,Fcan mirror the success seen at the
OL,10,FChristmas Market in the neighbouring
OL,11,Fcity of York, where 80% of traders are
OL,12,Flocal.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/3
